WEBVTT

01:26.920 --> 01:29.756
The January reports
are just coming in now?

01:31.132 --> 01:34.093
Now this is deplorable.

01:34.594 --> 01:39.724
A 17-year-old wolf
eating the leg of their deer friend.

01:40.391 --> 01:42.936
New day, same old story.

01:44.687 --> 01:46.022
Wait a minute.

01:46.105 --> 01:46.940
REPORT
NAME: LEGOSHI

01:47.023 --> 01:50.360
"The act was carried out
with mutual consent from both parties,

01:51.027 --> 01:56.574
aiming to bring the perpetrator
of a criminal devouring to justice."

01:57.534 --> 02:01.496
Fighting fire with fire, I see.

02:01.579 --> 02:02.497
DISCHARGED

02:02.580 --> 02:03.873
Very interesting.

02:05.125 --> 02:07.961
But a dangerous way of thinking.

02:08.044 --> 02:09.045
TOP SECRET

02:09.129 --> 02:13.258
Mutual consent or not,
this is unacceptable.

02:18.471 --> 02:20.181
I won't allow it...

02:22.142 --> 02:23.726
as the Beastar of this world.

02:45.623 --> 02:50.962
AN ITCHY COLLAR

03:09.022 --> 03:15.862
BEAST APARTMENTS

04:16.005 --> 04:17.465
<i>Eat me, Legoshi.</i>

04:19.717 --> 04:21.427
<i>My first and last meat.</i>

04:22.428 --> 04:23.805
<i>Can I keep that promise?</i>

04:23.888 --> 04:26.266
<i>- Pick any finger you like.
- That taste.</i>

04:27.058 --> 04:28.059
<i>That texture.</i>

04:28.559 --> 04:30.979
<i>- You want a sip? Rabbit's blood.
- That flavor.</i>

04:31.062 --> 04:32.063
<i>Sliding down my throat...</i>

04:35.316 --> 04:36.651
<i>So warm.</i>

04:38.027 --> 04:39.237
<i>So powerless.</i>

04:40.488 --> 04:41.406
<i>So sorrowful.</i>

04:42.532 --> 04:45.785
<i>You are delighted
from the bottom of your heart.</i>

04:45.868 --> 04:50.999
<i>Your true nature is nothing
but a dark, ferocious carnivore.</i>

04:51.124 --> 04:55.253
<i>This blood has always tortured me.</i>

04:58.923 --> 05:03.761
<i>I want to make this world
a safe place for Haru to live.</i>

05:05.638 --> 05:06.639
<i>And yet...</i>

05:09.892 --> 05:11.686
<i>The blood that runs through me</i>

05:12.687 --> 05:14.897
<i>still craves the taste of living flesh!</i>

05:37.879 --> 05:42.592
<i>I can't take this night after night!
I have work tomorrow!</i>

05:47.930 --> 05:50.558
<i>He didn't even introduce himself
when he moved in.</i>

05:50.641 --> 05:54.771
<i>What a jerk.
I'm gonna give him a piece of my mind.</i>

06:01.903 --> 06:03.237
<i>A wolf?</i>

06:05.114 --> 06:09.619
<i>What should I do?
Complaining might not be the best idea.</i>

06:17.585 --> 06:19.462
G-Good evening.

06:23.800 --> 06:28.054
I'm Seven from next door.

06:28.137 --> 06:29.263
Nice to meet--

06:36.395 --> 06:40.983
<i>He ignored me? What's his problem?
Unbelievable. We live in a society!</i>

06:43.361 --> 06:45.446
<i>Sorry, neighbor.</i>

07:08.511 --> 07:10.471
<i>No sign of carnivorous activity.</i>

07:12.473 --> 07:15.601
<i>Maybe he's not eating meat after all?</i>

07:17.228 --> 07:19.439
<i>That doesn't explain his strange symptoms.</i>

07:21.858 --> 07:24.235
<i>This is no normal meat intoxication.</i>

07:26.988 --> 07:28.448
Your delivery is here.

07:28.948 --> 07:29.991
Thanks.

07:30.616 --> 07:31.617
Come in.

07:34.704 --> 07:35.997
Put it down there.

07:41.544 --> 07:44.755
Udon with bamboo leaf topping.

07:44.839 --> 07:47.341
Sorry for the wait. That'll be 500 yen.

07:48.092 --> 07:50.219
You look good in any outfit.

07:50.803 --> 07:52.513
You mean like the cross-dressing incident?

07:52.597 --> 07:56.058
Now that freaked me out.
I thought my ex had come back.

07:57.643 --> 07:58.644
Take a seat.

08:00.938 --> 08:03.316
What are you about to do?

08:04.734 --> 08:06.903
I'm all right.

08:08.988 --> 08:09.989
Just one sip...

08:12.074 --> 08:13.075
Kines...

08:13.159 --> 08:19.916
I was planning on doing jail time
for eating an herbivore's leg.

08:21.125 --> 08:25.046
But thanks to
Louis and everyone's testimonies,

08:25.129 --> 08:28.841
I was let off with a minor offense.

08:29.926 --> 08:34.222
However, the crime of devouring
will go on my permanent record.

08:34.764 --> 08:37.725
A virgin ex-con
with scars on his face, huh?

08:38.768 --> 08:42.396
So, you're still
catching and treating offenders?

08:45.816 --> 08:47.693
Things have gotten worse.

08:48.861 --> 08:51.739
How would you like
to help me with my work again?

08:52.740 --> 08:54.200
I pay better than the udon place.

08:54.283 --> 08:55.701
I don't need it.

08:55.785 --> 08:57.828
I don't want your dirty money.

08:58.496 --> 09:00.289
The hell did you just say?

09:02.250 --> 09:05.628
All I want is to do honest work
in mainstream society

09:05.711 --> 09:10.007
and live a happy family life with Haru.

09:12.760 --> 09:14.762
On that note, what's your family like?

09:16.889 --> 09:19.016
My family? I...

09:19.100 --> 09:23.271
Don't tell me anything you don't want to.
I was only asking.

09:23.354 --> 09:24.438
Well...

09:25.523 --> 09:27.191
I don't have a mother or father.

09:28.359 --> 09:30.152
I was raised by my grandpa.

09:31.529 --> 09:33.030
Is he doing well?

09:33.531 --> 09:34.532
I think so.

09:37.118 --> 09:38.119
I see.

09:39.579 --> 09:43.291
It's not like we don't get along, I just...

09:45.042 --> 09:47.420
I haven't told him about the arrest.

09:52.967 --> 09:54.969
Take this with you. It's that medicine.

09:56.470 --> 10:01.684
Your meat consumption withdrawals
might last up to three full moons.

10:01.767 --> 10:02.768
Just in case.

10:05.187 --> 10:06.188
Thank you.

10:06.814 --> 10:07.732
Sure.

10:08.941 --> 10:10.776
- Later.
- Excuse me.

10:15.906 --> 10:17.033
Legoshi!

10:17.116 --> 10:18.159
Yes?

10:18.242 --> 10:21.078
You mentioned the devouring
going on your record.

10:21.579 --> 10:22.413
Yes?

10:23.164 --> 10:24.165
I see.

10:24.248 --> 10:27.126
You won't get what you want
with a record of devouring.

10:28.127 --> 10:30.379
You can't marry an herbivore.

10:30.463 --> 10:31.464
What?

10:31.964 --> 10:33.049
I can't?

10:34.175 --> 10:35.635
What?

10:36.677 --> 10:43.643
<i>Haru!</i>

10:48.314 --> 10:49.940
Oh, to be young.

11:00.284 --> 11:01.285
<i>Ibuki.</i>

11:02.078 --> 11:05.623
<i>The king of the beasts
should be fierce and strong.</i>

11:06.874 --> 11:11.587
<i>But your mane is delicate and beautiful.</i>

11:22.890 --> 11:25.059
How is your leg doing?

11:25.976 --> 11:28.312
I'm able to walk better than I expected.

11:30.815 --> 11:34.360
They used the latest resources
and the most advanced technology.

11:35.236 --> 11:37.405
It shouldn't hinder your college life.

11:41.409 --> 11:42.910
Thank you.

11:44.870 --> 11:50.543
Your legs are meant to carry you forward
as a noble son of the Horns Conglomerate.

11:50.626 --> 11:53.379
They are not to be eaten by a carnivore.

11:54.797 --> 11:55.965
Yes, sir.

11:56.048 --> 11:59.301
I enjoyed your improv performance,
but enough is enough.

12:00.302 --> 12:02.721
So you want me to live
according to your script?

12:05.057 --> 12:07.977
I suppose so. But that's not all.

12:08.894 --> 12:13.149
I want you to think for yourself
and carry out the duties appointed to you.

12:16.402 --> 12:19.780
<i>I have to face things head-on this time.</i>

12:20.906 --> 12:22.700
<i>I will no longer live in the underworld.</i>

12:24.118 --> 12:27.788
<i>I must now decide
how I will live within this society.</i>

12:52.938 --> 12:56.567
You went to the Black Market, right?
Did you finally get a taste of meat?

12:57.234 --> 12:59.862
- What kind?
- Pig... I think.

12:59.945 --> 13:01.947
What do you mean, you "think"?

13:02.031 --> 13:04.116
Who cares what kind it was?

13:04.200 --> 13:05.451
I don't believe you.

13:07.745 --> 13:10.915
People didn't use to talk like that.

13:13.626 --> 13:14.960
OPENING CEREMONY

13:15.044 --> 13:16.045
Students,

13:16.879 --> 13:20.883
as you have all heard, starting this year,

13:20.966 --> 13:26.472
carnivores and herbivores
will be fully segregated.

13:27.973 --> 13:32.811
We mustn't have
a repeat of last year's tragedy.

13:34.104 --> 13:38.400
While it may be inconvenient,
we ask for your cooperation...

13:38.484 --> 13:40.611
Maybe now the classrooms won't stink.

13:40.694 --> 13:43.030
They're cutting it off at the source.

13:43.113 --> 13:45.199
- You said it.
- We can finally relax.

13:45.282 --> 13:47.701
To be honest,
separating us is probably for the best.

13:48.285 --> 13:50.996
- Great news for us.
- One less thing to deal with.

13:51.080 --> 13:52.081
You're right.

13:52.164 --> 13:56.585
Finally, I'd like to present this year's
advanced placement students.

13:56.669 --> 13:58.504
All dogs again, I'm sure.

13:58.587 --> 14:01.090
Please stand when your name is called.

14:02.258 --> 14:03.926
A class, Lando.

14:05.886 --> 14:07.805
C class, Danny.

14:09.473 --> 14:11.475
E class, Jack.

14:13.185 --> 14:15.020
F class, Lance.

14:15.896 --> 14:17.731
G class, Mick.

14:18.774 --> 14:20.526
Let's give these five students a hand.

14:23.028 --> 14:25.698
Congrats, Jack!

14:25.781 --> 14:26.949
Thank you.

14:27.032 --> 14:29.410
You're on your way to the big leagues now!

14:30.035 --> 14:32.913
Legoshi will be thrilled too.
His tail's gonna wag like crazy!

14:37.084 --> 14:38.335
Give me a second.

14:42.339 --> 14:43.340
Hello?

14:44.133 --> 14:47.845
<i>Jack, do you know where Legoshi is?</i>

14:47.928 --> 14:51.515
What? Is this his grandfather?

14:51.599 --> 14:53.350
- It's been a while!
- Legoshi's grandfather?

14:53.434 --> 14:56.604
<i>Is it true that Legoshi
dropped out of school?</i>

14:56.687 --> 14:58.898
<i>I got a refund for his tuition.</i>

14:58.981 --> 15:03.068
<i>I can't get a hold of him.
Have you heard anything?</i>

15:03.152 --> 15:04.904
He got rid of his phone.

15:05.571 --> 15:07.990
I thought you knew about him dropping out.

15:08.908 --> 15:10.075
GRADUATION

15:10.159 --> 15:12.661
Sorry to get upset, I'm just worried.

15:12.745 --> 15:16.999
<i>Please, calm down.
There's no need to worry about Legoshi.</i>

15:17.082 --> 15:17.917
But...

15:18.042 --> 15:23.213
<i>I'm sure he had
his reasons for dropping out.</i>

15:23.297 --> 15:25.799
<i>Legoshi's got a strong character.</i>

15:25.883 --> 15:30.971
I see. He's my only grandson, you know.

15:40.272 --> 15:41.523
Haru!

15:41.649 --> 15:44.234
- Over here!
- Sorry I'm late.

15:44.318 --> 15:47.154
Orientation took forever.

15:48.697 --> 15:51.617
Thanks for the invite.
I've been wanting to come here.

15:51.700 --> 15:53.410
The lattes here are delicious.

15:53.494 --> 15:54.662
I got the same thing.

15:54.745 --> 15:56.830
- Really?
- I'll get one next time.

15:56.914 --> 15:58.666
What classes did you sign up for?

15:58.749 --> 16:00.167
Oh, just whatever.

16:00.250 --> 16:03.587
<i>My first year of college
is off to a great start.</i>

16:03.671 --> 16:07.174
<i>I'm going to make the most of campus life.</i>

16:07.257 --> 16:10.803
<i>Goodbye to my days
of being bullied in high school.</i>

16:10.886 --> 16:16.058
Actually, I want to introduce
you two to my boyfriend.

16:16.141 --> 16:17.393
What?

16:17.476 --> 16:19.478
You got a boyfriend already?

16:19.561 --> 16:20.896
No way!

16:20.980 --> 16:22.314
- Did you know, Haru?
- Me?

16:22.398 --> 16:24.692
No. What's he like?

16:24.775 --> 16:26.944
Hey, over here!

16:33.158 --> 16:35.995
Yo! I'm Eado.

16:36.078 --> 16:38.205
This is my boyfriend.

16:41.959 --> 16:46.255
I thought you'd react like that.
It's surprising, I know.

16:46.338 --> 16:50.467
Dating Ako has been full of new things!
People's reactions being one of them.

16:50.551 --> 16:52.469
Do you smell something?

16:52.970 --> 16:55.681
- The stench of a carnivore.
- Wow, you're so trendy!

16:55.764 --> 16:57.599
Really makes you lose your appetite.

16:58.642 --> 17:04.189
In our day, no one would be caught dead
with a boyfriend from a different species.

17:04.273 --> 17:07.067
You'd have to be sick in the head
to date outside your species.

17:07.735 --> 17:11.405
They won't realize till it's too late
that it's safer to be with your own kind.

17:12.614 --> 17:14.575
Should we go somewhere else?

17:15.367 --> 17:16.368
Good idea.

17:17.494 --> 17:20.247
And we were having so much fun, too.

17:21.373 --> 17:22.207
Seriously.

17:23.125 --> 17:24.752
- Where to?
- Let's see...

17:26.253 --> 17:32.634
<i>Legoshi. The adult world
is even tougher than I thought.</i>

17:32.718 --> 17:34.970
COEXISTENCE THEORY: THE BASICS
VEGETABLE NUTRITION

18:06.043 --> 18:08.378
Kids these days will never understand.

18:09.296 --> 18:13.383
Things were much more exciting back then.

18:14.635 --> 18:17.096
I still remember it vividly.

18:18.388 --> 18:21.975
It started as a day to celebrate meat.

18:22.684 --> 18:25.896
That's why it's called
Meat Appreciation Day.

18:26.980 --> 18:31.110
Now it's just a day
for Black Market territorial disputes.

18:34.404 --> 18:37.324
<i>The Komodo dragons' Doku-Gumi.</i>

18:37.407 --> 18:38.700
All right! Here we go!

18:39.284 --> 18:41.120
<i>The red foxes' Inari-Gumi.</i>

18:42.371 --> 18:44.123
<i>The leopards' Madara-Gumi.</i>

18:45.249 --> 18:47.042
<i>The lions' Shishi-Gumi.</i>

18:49.711 --> 18:54.424
<i>Up until last year,
their influence was huge.</i>

18:54.508 --> 18:56.009
<i>Now they're on the decline.</i>

18:57.427 --> 19:01.348
Without a boss,
you can't really call yourself a gang.

19:02.558 --> 19:05.561
In honor of Meat Appreciation Day,
I'll give you a good deal.

19:06.520 --> 19:08.856
Please, try to do it in one bite.

19:11.608 --> 19:13.986
Wait, you're not a carnivore.

19:47.603 --> 19:50.981
I can't take it anymore!
I've got to make a complaint.

20:04.203 --> 20:05.329
So careless...

20:17.174 --> 20:18.091
Excuse me.

20:20.510 --> 20:21.637
Are you oka--

20:35.067 --> 20:38.820
I'm begging you!
Can't you give us a little longer?

20:38.904 --> 20:43.742
I can't give you the drugs
if you don't bring me the ingredients.

20:43.825 --> 20:47.746
Things have been hectic, you know?

20:47.829 --> 20:50.707
Too busy eating your handsome boss?

20:50.791 --> 20:51.917
What?

20:52.000 --> 20:54.461
It's no matter to me.

20:55.420 --> 21:00.968
You're not the only gang
who can get me Hyperdrug ingredients.

21:01.051 --> 21:03.845
We'll have them by next week.

21:03.929 --> 21:05.722
That won't do.

21:06.682 --> 21:11.561
If you can't even get your hands on
a single piece of ivory...

21:14.189 --> 21:16.608
Is this what you're looking for?

21:22.572 --> 21:27.828
This is a first-rate specimen!
That's the Shishi-Gumi I know.

21:28.453 --> 21:30.372
Who is that?

21:30.455 --> 21:31.373
Beats me.

21:31.957 --> 21:36.878
That should be enough to make the drugs.
Have it ready by the deadline.

21:36.962 --> 21:38.255
Understood.

21:38.964 --> 21:42.301
Rich for you
to be talking about deadlines.

21:55.230 --> 21:57.441
What the hell are you doing?

22:00.110 --> 22:02.821
Watch your mouth, you stupid cat.

22:04.072 --> 22:07.409
Call me Boss from now on.

23:36.915 --> 23:41.920
Subtitle translation by: Thomas Grathwol
